        "TileImage": "$($repository 402f12dc-57ee-472e-9678-2bdafed041ce).Image",
        "Description": "Cooking for a militia of this size is no easy feat - hot meals three times a day for dozens of people, out here in the middle of nowhere? And yet not a single person has complimented you on the food in weeks! Time to take out your frustations using the tools of the trade. You want to keep the job (and your life) though, so best keep it discreet.",
